    "productDescriptionProps": {
      "paragraphs": [
        "Soft, simple shapes with well-thought-out details, such as wrinkles on the back cushions and rounded legs – creating a timeless sofa that feels both inviting and traditional.",
        "The seat cushion is built with zig-zag springs and foam, providing medium-firm comfort. The back cushion has foam filling that helps it keep its shape over time.",
        "The backrest is stored inside the armrests, making the packaging smaller and easier to bring home.",
        "The cover is made from the chenille fabric Silkeryd. It has a soft, tactile surface with a subtle texture that creates a refined expression and holds up well over time.",
        "10-year limited warranty. Read about the terms in the limited warranty brochure."
      ],
